    "encoding_note": "DDR5 transmits unencoded parallel binary on DQ (optionally DBI-coded) double-pumped on DQS_t/DQS_c; commands use a 2-cycle CA encoding on CA[13:0]. Integrity is provided by on-die ECC, optional write CRC, and command/address parity. Speed bins span DDR5-3200 .. DDR5-8400 MT/s at 1.1 V VDD/VDDQ."
